 "notes": [
  "The list has no section headers; the first three lines (Tatooine: Desert Landing Site, Combat Readiness, Tatooine: Jabba's Palace) are the starting cards and count toward the 60.",
  "The description says this is what he used at the UK Open the day before (31 August 2001); the strategy says the deck was 7–1 in tournament play, its only loss to Alex Tennet. The wiki has no page for a 2001 UK Open event, so it stays a general deck.",
  "Posted 'Tat Jabbas Palace' dested the Dark Jabba's Palace site Tatooine: Jabba's Palace; 'Audience Chamber' Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber (Dark); 'Cantina' Tatooine: Cantina (Dark); 'Come Here You Big Coward' the Special Edition Effect (the Defensive Shield is from Reflections III, after this post).",
  "Posted 'Sense (Premier)' and 'Alter (Premier)' dested the Dark Premiere printings, Sense (Dark) (Premiere) and Alter (Dark) (Premiere).",
  "Posted 'Mauls Stick' dested Maul's Lightsaber; a crude nickname for Mara's weapon dested Mara Jade's Lightsaber (the deck plays two Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand); 'Epp Vader' Darth Vader With Lightsaber; '4lom with gun' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'iggy with gun' IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'Galid' Gailid; 'Mara Jade, TEH' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Combat Rediness' Combat Readiness; 'Sebulbas Pod' Sebulba's Podracer."
